# Dockerfile lint rules with no security dimension, suppressed for Socket Basics.
#
# Trivy reads this file from the working directory. socket-basics has no config
# key that can disable a Trivy rule, so this is the only lever.
#
# Rules that ARE kept: DS-0002 (no USER -- runs as root), DS-0001 (:latest tag),
# DS-0017 (package-manager update alone, which can install from a stale index).

# 'apt-get' missing '--no-install-recommends' -- image size, not security.
DS-0029
# 'RUN cd ...' instead of WORKDIR -- pure style.
DS-0013
# Deprecated MAINTAINER instruction -- a deprecation notice, rated high.
DS-0022
# 'apk add' missing '--no-cache' -- image size, not security.
DS-0025
# WORKDIR path not absolute -- style.
DS-0009
# 'apt-get' missing '-y' -- build correctness, not security.
DS-0021
